WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:24.000
Primary forms. Notice what changes and what stays the same.

00:00:24.000 --> 00:00:31.000
LEARNING TARGET: Block out volumes before details

00:00:31.000 --> 00:00:38.000
THE BIG IDEA: Block primary volumes before adding lamps, vents or trim. Large forms establish the composition and constrain later detail.

00:00:38.000 --> 00:00:45.000
WORKED EXAMPLE: Build the body from cabin, front volume, rear volume and wheel/tire circles; only then add a small opening.

00:00:45.000 --> 00:00:52.000
PAUSE AND PREDICT: Shape construction

00:00:52.000 --> 00:00:59.000
MODEL LIMIT: A view supports interpretation; it cannot prove hidden structure or compliance alone.

00:00:59.000 --> 00:01:06.000
TAKEAWAY: Block out volumes before details
